                            	   769: UpdateBlock_JumpTable:
02:00039A8E 00039A9A        	   770:     dc.l    UpdateBlock0Idle   ; jump table entry (32-bit for _m68k_tablejump)
02:00039A92 00039B84        	   771:     dc.l    UpdateBlock1Moving   ; jump table entry (32-bit for _m68k_tablejump)
