                            	  2338: __far_z_04_0019:
02:0003A5C2 61000592        	  2339:     jsr     UpdateBurrower
                            	  2340:     ; If zora died in the call above, then it happened while in
                            	  2341:     ; states 2, 3, or 4. In the code below, the state won't be 0.
                            	  2342:     ; So, it won't flag the zora inactive. This is why the zora does
                            	  2343:     ; not come back after killing it.
                            	  2344:     ;
                            	  2345:     ; If state <> 3 or timer <> $FD,
                            	  2346:     ; then go see if the object needs to be destroyed.
                            	  2347:     ;
