                            	  7134: UpdateDodongoState_JumpTable:
02:0003C81A 0003C826        	  7135:     dc.l    UpdateDodongoState0_Move   ; jump table entry (32-bit for _m68k_tablejump)
02:0003C81E 0003C89C        	  7136:     dc.l    UpdateDodongoState1_Bloated   ; jump table entry (32-bit for _m68k_tablejump)
02:0003C822 0003C884        	  7137:     dc.l    UpdateDodongoState2_Stunned   ; jump table entry (32-bit for _m68k_tablejump)
