                            	  1053:     ; then cue transfer of a row of blanks above the play area.
                            	  1054:     ; This should lead to clean vertical scrolling without visual
                            	  1055:     ; artifacts.
                            	  1056:     ;
                            	  1057:     ; TODO: But, maybe it doesn't work, because its address
