                            	  1911: _L_z05_InitMode_EnterRoom_ChooseWalkDistance:
                            	  1912:     ; Choose a distance to walk depending on the door you
                            	  1913:     ; come out of.
                            	  1914:     ;
                            	  1915:     ; We'll get a 0 or 1 depending on the direction of the door.
                            	  1916:     ;
                            	  1917:     ; If the attribute of the door is "open", "key", or "key 2";
                            	  1918:     ; then you have shorter distance to cover. So use the
                            	  1919:     ; previous value as is to use indexes 0 and 1.
                            	  1920:     ;
                            	  1921:     ; Otherwise, add 2 to use indexes 2 and 3 to walk farther
                            	  1922:     ; to get out of the way of the wall or door.
                            	  1923:     ;
