                            	  8359:     ; Shift right. The value in A is now (menu scroll value) / 2,
                            	  8360:     ; and represents the current row of the submenu being processed.
                            	  8361:     ; The bottom bit tells us (1) whether to transfer a full row of
                            	  8362:     ; black tiles, or (0) a row of the triforce or other piece of the GUI.
                            	  8363:     ;
                            	  8364:     ; If the bottom bit is set, go prepare the full black row.
